# OintOS Gaming Packages
#
# DISABLED for the Phase 3 prototype.
#
# Steam requires the i386 (multiarch) runtime (steam-libs-i386) which, in
# live-build, needs i386 package indexes present in the chroot BEFORE the
# app-install pass. Getting multiarch+virtual/dependency resolution right in
# live-build is fiddly, and per the master prompt full gaming integration is
# explicitly Phase 9. Keeping steam/wine out lets the prototype ISO complete
# so we can validate the KDE desktop + base system first.
#
# Re-enable in Phase 9 together with a proper i386 multiarch configuration.
#
# steam-installer
# wine
# wine64
# winetricks
